O1 nam mo nhieu ngay duoi dang cau hoi "ban thu hai co ton tai khong". Do la cau hoi SAI, va
sai theo cach khong ai phat hien duoc: mot tep co mat, dung ten, dung kich thuoc, van co the
la tep KHONG KHOI PHUC DUOC — hong mot byte, chep nham the he, hoac la ban cua mang da chet.
Cau hoi dung: "da co ai khoi phuc thu tu no chua".

Mot ban sao chua tung duoc khoi phuc thi chua phai mot ban sao.

kiem-khoa doc keys.txt, SUY LAI X-addr · P-addr · dia chi EVM · privkey EVM tu chinh khoa bi
mat trong do, roi so voi thu tep TU KHAI. Them -allocation de doi chieu CHEO: bang CONG KHAI
co khai dung nhung dia chi ma bo khoa BI MAT that su mo duoc khong (chieu allocation ⊆ keys —
mot dia chi duoc CONG BO ma khong ai giu khoa la mot loi hua rong).

HOAN TOAN OFFLINE, co y: thu dang kiem la mot ban sao LANH, mang no toi cho co mang de kiem la
lam hong dung tinh chat khien no dang gia. Va KHONG in khoa bi mat ra man hinh, ke ca khi lech
— chi in vi tri dong.

NGHIEM THU tren bo khoa g0 THAT (vua cuu ve may dev, sha256 khop server):
  XANH  6/6 quy khoi phuc dung + doi chieu cheo 6/6 dia chi trong allocation.md
  DO    doi 1 ky tu trong THAN khoa cb58 cua foundation -> "invalid input checksum", exit 1
  DO    bang cong khai khai mot dia chi khong ai giu khoa -> exit 1
  DO    tep rong -> "tep rong ≡ tep hong", exit 1  (bo kiem 0 muc ma thoat 0 la bo kiem noi doi)
  DO    co dat SAU duong dan -> exit 2

HAI LOI CHINH CONG CU NAY MAC PHAI, giu lai trong chu thich vi ca hai la lop loi cua repo:
  1. regex ten truong viet [A-Za-z ] nen nuot duoc "EVM addr" ma roi mat "X-addr"/"P-addr".
     Hau qua khong phai "bo qua": truong rong so voi dia chi suy ra thi LECH => bo kiem bao DO
     tren mot bo khoa HOAN TOAN DUNG. Mot cong bao dong gia se bi bo qua dung luc no keu that.
     => tach "THIEU TRUONG" ra khoi "TRUONG LECH".
  2. `flag` dung phan tich o doi so khong phai co dau tien, nen `kiem-khoa keys.txt -allocation
     x.md` chay tron tru va BO QUA -allocation trong im lang. Chi thoat vi dong canh bao cuoi
     bai noi ra la no chua chay. Nay chan thang: mot phep kiem bi bo qua phai on hon mot phep
     kiem that bai.

